+/**
+ * fp_print_get_identify_score:
+ * @print: A #FpPrint
+ *
+ * timeclock-system: the bozorth3 score @print got in the last identify whose gallery held it, so a caller can compare
+ * the gallery's scores itself. -1 if @print has not been in an identify gallery.
+ *
+ * Returns: The score, or -1
